# Object Property: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002254> (has developmental contribution from)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002254> "x has developmental contribution from y iff x has some part z such that z develops from y"@en)
