AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002304> "p is causally upstream of, positive effect q iff p is casually upstream of q, and the execution of p is required for the execution of q.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002304> "causally upstream of, positive effect")
SubObjectPropertyOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002304> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002411>)
